# .ignore — paths excluded from the canonical source tree (not .gitignore)

This file documents directories that exist locally but are explicitly outside the
authoritative project. `.gitignore` remains the mechanism for VCS exclusions.

.trash/        # retired prior-version docs (historical, non-authoritative)
.studio/       # local runtime state (config, state, cache, logs, manifests)
.secrets/      # runtime secrets
.venv/         # python virtualenv
